{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms: No Way Out is an immersive survival horror game featuring various famous backrooms levels, terrifying entities, and unique gameplay. Up to 4 players can join together to explore the dangerous levels and search for a way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/40e3324e606040f6fc1d6cccd6e1f370.webp?t=1773445993\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features realistic graphics and spatialized audio to create the best immersive experience, creating the feeling of truly being lost in the backrooms without a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/3c6c352d281aaac4d9726fbc714fdd67.poster.avif?t=1773445993\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/3c6c352d281aaac4d9726fbc714fdd67.webm?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/3c6c352d281aaac4d9726fbc714fdd67.mp4?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/e622ecc311be3a5cdee89cfe287a4f8f.webp?t=1773445993\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras_big/e622ecc311be3a5cdee89cfe287a4f8f.webp?t=1773445993 width=800 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the levels with a team of up to 4 players. Work together to escape each level and find the way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/1e2555ec5c9d8073c77204f73bd80869.poster.avif?t=1773445993\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/1e2555ec5c9d8073c77204f73bd80869.webm?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/1e2555ec5c9d8073c77204f73bd80869.mp4?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/722a8b02ab6d6ea575f129ef0560af56.webp?t=1773445993\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level was designed and created to be as immersive and enjoyable to play as possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/067a299f92364ea941c5c1f0a12f3423.poster.avif?t=1773445993\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/067a299f92364ea941c5c1f0a12f3423.webm?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/067a299f92364ea941c5c1f0a12f3423.mp4?t=1773445993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a